1
00:00:00,747 --> 00:00:02,177
(Sheldon:)I've come up with three ideas.

2
00:00:02,182 --> 00:00:03,782
(Sheldon:)The first is a chance for her

3
00:00:03,784 --> 00:00:05,614
(Sheldon:)to play the harp
with the L.A. Philharmonic.

4
00:00:05,619 --> 00:00:07,349
(Penny:)Wow. You can really
arrange that?

5
00:00:07,354 --> 00:00:08,884
(Sheldon:)Well, I said a chance,
you know.

6
00:00:08,889 --> 00:00:10,319
(Sheldon:)When you tell them
it's your birthday

7
00:00:10,324 --> 00:00:11,724
(Sheldon:)at Bennigan's,
they make a fuss.

8
00:00:11,725 --> 00:00:13,995
(Sheldon:)I don't see why the Philharmonic
would be any different.

9
00:00:14,895 --> 00:00:17,265
(Bernadette:)How about something
a little more realistic?

10
00:00:17,264 --> 00:00:19,864
(Sheldon:)Well, Amy enjoys
knitting her own sweaters,

11
00:00:19,867 --> 00:00:22,667
(Sheldon:)so I was thinking of getting her
an all-expense-paid trip

12
00:00:22,669 --> 00:00:25,509
(Sheldon:)to the Wisconsin Sheep
and Wool Festival.

13
00:00:28,242 --> 00:00:31,272
(Penny:)Sorry. I was waiting
for the bazinga.

14
00:00:31,979 --> 00:00:33,479
(Bernadette:)Hold on. It could be romantic.

15
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:34,910
(Bernadette:)The two of them away together,

16
00:00:34,915 --> 00:00:37,785
(Bernadette:)keeping each other warm
in snowy Wisconsin.

17
00:00:37,784 --> 00:00:39,314
(Sheldon:)No, no, no, no.
She'd be going alone.

18
00:00:39,319 --> 00:00:40,989
(Sheldon:)Well, if you think
I'm afraid of birds,

19
00:00:40,988 --> 00:00:42,288
(Sheldon:)you should see me around sheep.

20
00:00:42,289 --> 00:00:44,519
(Penny:)Okay, well,
what's the third option?

21
00:00:44,525 --> 00:00:45,995
(Sheldon:)That I have coitus with her.

22
00:00:45,993 --> 00:00:47,323
(glass shatters on floor)

23
00:00:54,401 --> 00:00:57,301
(Leonard:)What do you think about giving
Sheldon's ticket to Stuart?

24
00:00:57,304 --> 00:00:58,834
(Leonard:)I don't know.

25
00:00:58,839 --> 00:01:01,309
(Raj:)Have you ever seen a movie
with Stuart before?

